{"availability":"available","full":"WebDecoy/FCaptcha","name":"FCaptcha","description":"Self-hosted, invisible CAPTCHA that detects AI agents driving real browsers. GDPR, WCAG 2.2 AA, and EAA: no cookies, no third-party data sharing, and no visual or audio puzzle. With a false-positive budget enforced in CI. Proof of work, drop-in for Turnstile and reCAPTCHA.","category":"Finance","language":"JavaScript","stars":220,"forks":22,"created":"2025-12-29T04:54:40Z","updated":"2026-10-06T22:00:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://webdecoy.com/product/fcaptcha/","topics":["ai-bot-detection","anti-bot","behavioral-analysis","bot-detection","captcha","fingerprinting","go","headless-browser-detection","invisible-captcha","nodejs","playwright-detection","proof-of-work","puppeteer-detection","python","scraping-protection","security","selenium-detector","self-hosted","tls-fingerprinting","web-security"],"demo":"https://webdecoy.com/product/fcaptcha-demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.461Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.461Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.461Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.461Z","stars":220,"forks":22}],"technologies":["Node.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Prebuilt Docker image · Docker installation guide","FCaptcha is a modern CAPTCHA system designed to detect everything: traditional bots, headless browsers, automation frameworks, CAPTCHA farms, and the new generation of AI agents — from vision models that screenshot-and-click to computer-use agents that drive a real browser over the Chrome DevTools Protocol."],"features":["Drop-in for Turnstile / reCAPTCHA / hCaptcha - Serves the same siteverify contract on the same paths, so migrating an existing backend is a base-URL change; tokens carry a signed hostname and action your app can check","Single click or invisible - Checkbox mode like Turnstile/reCAPTCHA v2, or invisible mode like reCAPTCHA v3","AI agent detection - Catches vision agents (screenshot→API→click), DOM/CDP-driven agents (Claude in Chrome, Operator-style computer use), and synthetic input that reports isTrusted: true — via input-event forensics and…","Declared & verified agents - Flags self-declaring agents (ClaudeBot, GPTBot, ChatGPT-User, PerplexityBot, Bytespider…) and cryptographically verifies Web Bot Auth (RFC 9421) signed requests against the agent's published…","Proof of Work - Server-verified SHA-256 hashcash with 256-bit HMAC signing, per-challenge nonces, and signal commitment that binds the challenge to the collected signals. A liveness and timing gate rather than a cost…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WebDecoy/FCaptcha/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e8eb21390a57db6536942a81754530bcb4dfcf9dab82396696283c7f2dd8807a","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.584Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.584Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Prebuilt Docker image · Docker installation guide","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WebDecoy/FCaptcha/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No GitHub login or source build is required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WebDecoy/FCaptcha/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"If you want proof of work to genuinely raise an attacker's cost, the lever is the server-measured elapsed time, not the hash.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WebDecoy/FCaptcha/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"Set action (and optionally cdata) when you request the token — FCaptcha.execute(siteKey, { action: 'login' }) — and they are bound into it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WebDecoy/FCaptcha/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e8eb21390a57db6536942a81754530bcb4dfcf9dab82396696283c7f2dd8807a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WebDecoy/FCaptcha/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:44.585Z"},"overviewRep